sequenceDiagram
    %% executed from https://example.org/chat/send_message
    %% path: start, persist_user_msg, route_to_provider, invoke_llm, persist_response, stream_complete_event, end
    %% run: run-1
    actor authenticated_user as Authenticated users
    participant chat_ui as Chat Web Interface
    participant chat_api as Chat API
    participant message_db as Message Store
    participant llm_gateway as LLM Provider Gateway
    authenticated_user->>chat_ui: send_message (policy: user_send_policy)
    chat_ui->>chat_api: POST send_message_op [MessageShape]
    Note over chat_api: start send_message_process
    chat_api->>chat_api: persist_user_msg, send_message_op (in process)
    chat_api->>message_db: persist_user_msg writes MessageShape
    Note over chat_api: t_send → sending
    chat_api->>chat_api: route_to_provider (DMN routing_decision) = default-provider
    chat_api->>llm_gateway: invoke_llm, completion_op /v1/chat/completions
    llm_gateway-->>chat_api: 3 deltas
    chat_api-->>chat_ui: stream_events (3 token deltas)
    Note over chat_api: t_stream → streaming
    chat_api->>message_db: persist_response writes MessageShape
    Note over chat_api: t_finish → complete
    chat_api-->>chat_ui: stream_events (stream.events event)
